			"notes": "Release v1.4.0: Performance & HUD Update\n\n  This release focuses on mitigating latency in competitive PVP environments and adds highly requested HUD utilities.\n\n  ⚔️ New Features\n   * Crystal Optimizer: Immediate client-side removal of End Crystals upon attack, allowing for zero-delay placement.\n   * Anchor Optimizer: Replaces exploded Respawn Anchors with a client-side placeholder, ensuring the coordinate is clear for immediate follow-up placements without waiting for server confirmation.\n   * CPS HUD: Fully customizable Clicks-Per-Second tracker with a \"Smart Rainbow\" mode and movable HUD overlay.\n   * Armor Durability HUD: Real-time tracking of armor and hand items, featuring low-durability blink alerts.\n   * Vanilla Settings Tab: Consolidated shortcuts for Mouse Sensitivity, Auto Jump, Fullscreen, and other core game settings.\n\n  🔧 Improvements & Fixes\n   * Competitive Preset: Auto-enables both Crystal and Anchor optimizers.\n   * GUI Cleanup: Tabs renamed and reorganized for better clarity.\n   * Compatibility: Cleaned up redundant mixins for better stability with other performance mods.\n   * 1.21.11 Support: Fully optimized for the current version.\n\n  📌 License & Code Usage\n  This project is released under All Rights Reserved. Please do not reupload this mod or its source code to Modrinth, CurseForge, or any other platform without my explicit permission. If you'd like to use the code, reach out via\n  email (yag.fvt@gmail.com) — I am open to discussing it, but please ask first.\n\n  ---\n\n  Installation:\n   1. Requires Fabric API, Cloth Config, and Mod Menu.\n   2. Drop the .jar file into your mods folder."
		},
